OL,3,GNEWSASon carries on missing parents'
OL,4,Ateaching legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA son whose parents remain missing
OL,7,Fafter the catastrophic floods in Nepal
OL,8,Fhas vowed to continue the family
OL,9,Fbusiness to "honour their legacy".
OL,11,FDeepesh Patel said he and his brother
OL,12,Fwere "taking it one step at a time" as
OL,13,Fthey await news of their mother Mala
OL,14,Fand father Bipin, who crossed from
OL,15,FNepal into Tibet before a landslide
OL,16,Fstruck the Gyirong border seven weeks
OL,17,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
