OL,3,GNEWSASon carries on missing parents'
OL,4,Ateaching legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the search continues, Patel, from
OL,7,FCoventry, has taken on responsibility
OL,8,Ffor his parents' First Class Learning
OL,9,Fbusiness which provides after-school
OL,10,Facademic tuition in the city.
OL,12,F"I'm sure my parents would have would
OL,13,Fhave wanted it to carry on, and I'll do
OL,14,Fmy best to try and fill their shoes,"
OL,15,FPatel said.
